WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.612
Two outputs carry the chapter's end date.

2
00:00:02.612 --> 00:00:06.259
The island list holds every
account that will stay on Kerberos,

3
00:00:06.259 --> 00:00:10.047
under the name it will end up with,
along with its owner, its end date,

4
00:00:10.047 --> 00:00:13.624
and whether it's ready to hand to
the program's retirement work.

5
00:00:13.624 --> 00:00:18.125
The hand-off flag only turns true
when every single row is ready.

6
00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:21.421
The reconciliation covers
every managed account,

7
00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:24.325
existing or planned, and
says where it ends up.

8
00:00:24.325 --> 00:00:29.087
When the program confirms its end-state
decision, that file changes in

9
00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:33.910
a reviewed pull request and the run
is repeated well before A D retires.
